translatedText:
Thomas 'TomTom' Lindinger claims: "Slopers are the ultimate challenge for many climbers and boulderers." But he doesn't just leave you with this assertion; he also provides solutions for how to better manage slopers in climbing and bouldering.

If you want to try out his tips directly on the featured boulder in the video, visit us at the DAV Climbing and Bouldering Center Upper Bavaria South (Bad Tölz). The boulder will remain in place until the city championship on July 1, 2023. Even after that, you'll certainly find several boulders with slopers at our center where you can test his tips.

Have fun practicing your technique! If you have any further questions, feel free to ask them in the comments...

